OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor to stand in by-election
OL,4,Ahe triggered
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former councillor who lost his seat
OL,7,Fafter failing to turn up to a single
OL,8,Fcouncil meeting for six months will
OL,9,Fstand in the by-election he triggered.
OL,11,FJohn Allen was elected to represent
OL,12,FAshington's Hirst ward on
OL,13,FNorthumberland County Council in May
OL,14,F2025.
OL,16,FAllen, who was a member of Reform UK at
OL,17,Fthe time, was expelled from the party
OL,18,Flater that year following allegations
OL,19,Fhe made online comments saying he
OL,20,Fwanted to shoot the then prime minister
OL,21,FKeir Starmer.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
